codex
Implemented Story 5.4 and completed the dev-story workflow end to end. The map is now a calmer static orientation surface with a clear Royal Institution anchor, aligned presenter/snapshot locality copy, fallback-specific orientation text, and regression coverage that blocks a return to decorative corridor styling.

Validation is green: `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`, and `npm run build` all passed. The story is marked `review` in [5-4-redesign-the-local-map-for-practical-usefulness.md](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/5-4-redesign-the-local-map-for-practical-usefulness.md) and in [sprint-status.yaml](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/sprint-status.yaml).

