**Findings**
1. Medium: Story 5.5’s no-scroll guard was too weak. The smoke test would pass if `globals.css` contained either the shell row layout or a scrollable `overflow-y: auto`, so a scrollable board could still satisfy the story contract. Fixed in [startup-smoke.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/smoke/startup-smoke.test.mjs#L444) by asserting the exact desktop no-scroll shell rule.
2. Medium: The canonical public board still allowed vertical scrolling on the supported desktop display path, which weakens AC1’s “default view is no-scroll” requirement. Fixed in [globals.css](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/app/globals.css#L1962) by pinning the `1024px+` board to a one-screen shell and preserving the compact-height override.
3. Medium: Review bookkeeping was incomplete. The story was still `review`, sprint tracking still said `review`, and the story file list did not reflect the review-time files that now carry the contract. Fixed in [5-5-revalidate-the-public-screen-against-board-readability-criteria.md](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/5-5-revalidate-the-public-screen-against-board-readability-criteria.md#L3) and [sprint-status.yaml](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/sprint-status.yaml#L70).

No open high or medium issues remain from this review pass.

**What Changed**
The no-scroll contract is now explicit in [globals.css](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/app/globals.css#L1962), reinforced by the stronger Story 5.5 smoke assertion in [startup-smoke.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/smoke/startup-smoke.test.mjs#L444), and aligned with the existing header guardrail in [dashboard.header.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/dashboard.header.test.mjs#L22). I also updated the validation artifact to record the follow-up resolution in [5-5-public-board-readability-validation.md](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/5-5-public-board-readability-validation.md#L39), and moved Story 5.5 to `done` in the story file and sprint tracker.

Verification passed: `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`, and `npm run build`.
